{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24962","headline":"山寺律僧画兰竹图 · 牟融","name":"山寺律僧画兰竹图","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"偶来绝顶兴无穷，独有山僧笔最工。\n绿径日长袁户在，紫荃秋晚谢庭空。\n离花影度湘江月，遗佩香生洛浦风。\n欲结岁寒盟不去，忘机相对画图中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牟融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24962.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24962","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}